#: ../../usage/save.rst:4
msgid ":index:`Saving Updated Files <files; saving, saving files>`"
msgstr ":index:`保存更新后的文件 <files; saving, saving files>`"

#: ../../usage/save.rst:8
msgid "This stage is where Picard updates the matched files with the metadata retrieved in the first stage, based on the settings configured in the Options. This may also include renaming the files and placing them in a different directory."
msgstr ""
"此阶段是 Picard 根据选项中配置的设置，使用第一阶段检索到的元数据更新匹配的文"
"件。这可能还包括重命名文件并将它们放置在不同的目录中。"

#: ../../usage/save.rst:10
msgid "When you are satisfied that your files have been properly matched to tracks in the right-hand pane, select the album you want to save in the right-hand pane and use :menuselection:`\"File --> Save\"` to save the files. A green check mark means the file was saved to its proper location."
msgstr ""
"当您满意文件已正确匹配到右侧窗格中的音轨时，请选择右侧窗格中要保存的专辑，并"
"使用 :menuselection:`\"文件 --> 保存\"` 来保存文件。绿色对勾表示文件已保存到"
"正确位置。"

#: ../../usage/save.rst:25
msgid "Once the files have been saved successfully, you can remove the album from the right-hand pane by selecting it and using :menuselection:`\"Edit --> Remove\"`. Note that this only removes the album from Picard and does not remove the files themselves."
msgstr ""
"文件成功保存后，您可以通过选择它并使用 :menuselection:`\"编辑 --> 移除\"` 从"
"右侧窗格中移除专辑。请注意，这仅从 Picard 中移除专辑，并不会移除文件本身。"
